  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contruction of borehole well at one of our target communities (Sengema)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will support Sengema Community with the construction of a borehole well. The community has challenges to provide sufficient and safe drinking water for the people. They trek miles away to fetch water from a small stream which is unsafe for drinking. Without clean water it is difficult to provide a safe living environment for the community. Sengema community is one of the target communities under the Jerusalem Trust project. The project hired water well supplier to dug, after several attempts, they were not able as a result of the plenty rocks around the community.
Therefore, CAFOD plan to Construct one bore-well in the community which will provide a sustainable supply of safe water for the inhabitants from CGF.</narrative>
  </description>
